# Files and directories left out of the plugin zip and the WordPress.org deploy.
# Read by bin/build-dist.sh (rsync --exclude-from) and by
# 10up/action-wordpress-plugin-deploy. GitHub's source archives are the whole
# repository on purpose: OpenSSF Scorecard reads them (see SECURITY.md).
